  <nav class="cw-page-nav" aria-label="Customer services"><a href="/book-history">My bookings</a><a href="/unit-assistance">Unit requests</a><a href="/relocation-requests" aria-current="page">Relocation requests</a><a href="/aftercare">Maintenance</a></nav>
  <details class="rr-guide"><summary><span><i class="bi bi-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>How an aircon move works</span><i class="bi bi-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
  <ol class="rr-process" aria-label="How relocation works"><li><span>1</span><div><strong>Staff reviews</strong><small>We check your locations</small></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>Review your quote</strong><small>See the price before booking</small></div></li><li><span>3</span><div><strong>Book and pay</strong><small>Choose your schedule</small></div></li><li><span>4</span><div><strong>We move your aircon</strong><small>Your technician completes the move</small></div></li></ol>
